Just have time for a quick suggestion:  Using functions like summarize(), create a new dataframe of moving averages (time t gets the average of itself + (x-1) proceeding observations).  Add a lag, so time t gets the average of x proceeding observations.  Join this to your observation dataframe, so the observation at time t and be compared to the average of x proceeding observations.

